# AirPlay Status — debug capture

**Normal:** `./bin/run-local.sh` — `/debug` and `/?debug=1` redirect to `/`.

**Debug:** `./bin/run-local.sh --debug` — verbose logs + marker UI at `/debug`.

When debugging: read `docs/debug-capture.md`, user runs with `--debug`, taps markers at `/debug`, says **done**, agent reads `/tmp/airplay-status-debug.log`.

Event semantics: `pend` = paused (keep UI), `aend` = disconnect (clear), ignore `prsm` after `pfls`, ignore connect-time spurious `pend`/`aend`.
